{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112833","id":3013994350,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zpedu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112833","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112833.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112833.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112833","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112833/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112833/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112833/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/449c21b447d37510fd831c17c8b2b0f5991f3e04","number":112833,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.NET] Allow for read-only properties and fields to be exported","user":{"login":"GabCoolDude","id":123309403,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mNWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123309403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude","html_url":"https://github.com/GabCoolDude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8502\r\n\r\nThis PR allows read only properties and fields to be exported.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n```cs\r\n// All of these used to cause GD103, but now they work.\r\n[Export] public readonly uint ReadonlyField = 999;\r\n[Export] public Resource GetterOnlyProperty { get; } = new();\r\n[Export] public Node ExpressionBody => GetNode(\"Node\"); \r\n```\r\n\r\nIt works by adding `PropertyUsage.ReadOnly` and removing `PropertyUsage.Storage` to properties and fields that are marked as read only; `PropertyUsage.Storage` is removed because read-only properties and fields can only be declared in code, which makes storing them useless. The GD103 diagnostic has also been removed as it's no longer needed, documentation should also be updated to reflect this.\r\n\r\nAFAIK exporting a read-only variable to godot should not cause any problems, and my testing has also proven this so far. [This](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23564228/C.Readonly.Export.Testing.zip) is the test project I've been using.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=